# Masking threshold cache: 484 MB, and regenerable with
#   scripts/ds_masking.py --dump-thresholds masking/T_ood.npz
masking/*.npz
# Raw training stdout, 269 MB -> 20 MB gzipped. The .gz alongside is what is
# kept: the diffmoog experiments/ tree is ignored, so these logs are the only
# surviving record of those runs and deleting them outright would lose the
# evidence behind section 06.
dm_*.log
archive_extract.log

# Listening demos from ds_floor_audio.py / ds_compare_audio.py. Regenerable,
# and tens of MB of wavs -- the scripts and their flags are the record.
db_listen/
mask_listen*/
*.tar.gz

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Generated evaluation output, Aug-Sep 2026. Same reasoning as db_listen/ and
# mask_listen*/ above: these are audio and per-run tables that any of the
# scripts reproduces from a checkpoint, and the scripts plus their flags are
# the record. What is NOT here, deliberately, is results/mushra/ -- listening
# sessions cannot be regenerated from anything.

# Renders written by ds_eval_folder --render, eval_real_ir and eval_convolved.
*_listen/
*_listen_*/
*_conv/
*_conv_*/
*_active/
compare_id*/
real_ir_eval/
prior_emt/
probe*/
emt[0-9]*_*/
korg_fin*/
low_korg/
high_korg/
saw_high/
f5o_low/
r13_b48/

# webMUSHRA test directories: copies of the renders plus a config, rebuilt by
# make_webmushra.py in seconds. The SESSIONS live in results/mushra/.
mushra_*/
mushra_id.html

# Per-run tables from ds_eval_folder / ds_osc_usage / ds_harmonic_probe. Kept
# out of the working tree; the ones a bundle needs are copied into paper/.
/*.csv

# Sample packs as downloaded. data/ is already ignored and these are the
# zips it came from.
17*__modularsamples__*.zip

# Generation and queue stdout. Unlike dm_*.log these are not the only record:
# the jobs_*.txt files carry the invocation and the datasets are regenerable
# from docs/DATASETS.md.
gen_emt*.log
queue_emt*.log
logs/

# NSynth per-class screen. ds_class_sweep.sh says it in its own header: "It is
# a screen, not a result."
results/class_sweep/
results/ddsp/
